<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Orogen maiden net profit A$20.67 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Orogen maiden net profit A$20.67 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    34.05</p>
<p>    Net				     20.67</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   2.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Orogen Minerals Ltd is a Papua New Guinea minerals group 51 percent owned by the Papua New Guinea government. The company said results included only eight months of trading since the company was incorporated in May 1996.  </p>
<p>    Sales				 71.00</p>
<p>    Other income			 1.74</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 19.81</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		     5.21</p>
<p>Dividend is nil franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 18</p>
<p>Reg date April 4</p>
<p>    Tax				   18.59</p>
<p>    Interest			     1.18</p>
<p>    Depreciation			16.43</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
